        "text": "Crypto is a lifeline. I found Binance in 2020 on YouTube when I searching about crypto exchanges. I learned all about crypto products and services. I didn't know at the time they would become a lifeline. Last February, Turkey had a big and deadly earthquake. My city had an epicenter of the earthquake. Our house collapsed, our car crashed, we lost everything. The bank's closed and access to money was cut off. Binance donated all our team victims $100 to Binance account. Binance donated my mother, my father and my sister account total of $300. Binance is on more than exchange. Binance is friends. Binance is family. Binance communities with us in our good days, in our bad days. None of us will ever forget that.",
